WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.167
Move the camera into observation pose

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:05.867
Locate the red cube and select a parking point

00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:13.133
Drive to the planned stopping point

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:16.500
Restore the default grasping pose

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.333
Take a fresh RGB-D pair and approach the cube

00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:24.000
Take a fresh RGB-D pair and approach the cube

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.333
Close the gripper and lift the red cube

00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:32.333
Release the cube and return the arm